# LLM dual-track (optional)

Copy to `.env` locally (never commit real keys). Cascade order:

1. `XIRANG_API_KEY` / `TOKENHUB_API_KEY` — sponsor placeholders
2. `SENSENOVA_API_KEY` — interim
3. `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` — interim (DashScope compatible-mode)
4. `LLM_API_KEY` — generic OpenAI-compatible key

```bash
# DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=
# LLM_API_KEY=
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1
# LLM_MODEL=qwen-plus
```

Without any key: `/api/health` reports `enhanced.demo_ready=false`; UI stays on rule mode.
With a key: restart `npm start`, then `/api/analyze-enhanced` becomes available.

Studio static Demo can also use the in-page「增强配置」panel (sessionStorage only).
